# the same functions with unboxed numbers withheld: the remainder is the number that the operator gives, and the quotient behind its test is a number
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: = Mod
# CHECK: = StrictEq
